 "text": "Recorder's Office\nLogin\nLog in\nRemember Me\nWeb Authentication\nForgot\nUsername or\nPassword ?\n218-683-7000\nMon - Fri 8:00 a.m. - 4:30 p.m.\nHome\nDepartments Assessor's Office\nAuditor's Office\nAttorney's Office\nDistrict Court\nEconomic Development\nElections\nEmergency Management\nExtension Office\nGIS Mapping\nHighway Department\nHuman Services\nPublic Health Pennington & Red Lake County Public Health & Home Care\nOpioid Settlement Advisory Council\nMotor Vehicle Licensing\nProbation / Supervised Release\nRecorder's Office\nSheriff's Office\nSoil and Water Conservation\nTreasurer's Office\nVeterans Services\nVictim Services\nGovernment County Board & Committees\nDocuments\nTownship Officers\nHow do I...? Apply For... Medical Assistance\nVeteran Services\nMy Passport\nSign Up For... Everbridge\nPay My... Property Tax\nCourt/Traffic Fine\nGet... Vehicle Tabs\nCourt Forms\nRoadway Permit\nEmployment\nCalendar\nPennington County Recorder's Office\nThe County Recorder's Office duties include:\nAccept, inspect, record and provide information from real estate documents.\nAccess computerized birth and death records. Provide copies of these records to the public.\nSell marriage licenses and marriage certificates.\nFile notary commissions.\nFile Minister's credentials.\nFile and provide information from computerized Uniform Commercial Code documents.\nLinks of Interest\nMinnesota Secretary of State\nMinnesota Department of Commerce\nBirth & Death Certificates\nOnline Marriage License\nRecording Checklist & Fee's\nIDOCMARKET\nJulie A Hansen\nPennington Government Center\nRecorder's Office\nPO Box 616\n101 Main Ave N\nThief River Falls, MN 56701\nPhone: 218-683-7027\nFax: 218-683-7026\nEmail\n© 2020 Pennington County, Minnesota. All Rights Reserved.\nHome\nDepartments\nAssessor's Office\nAuditor's Office\nAttorney's Office\nDistrict Court\nEconomic Development\nElections\nEmergency Management\nExtension Office\nGIS Mapping\nHighway Department\nHuman Service